From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard Swanson <rswanson05@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 15:41:58 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat: shade alternate tabs and number waiting agents

Every other tab of a space, and every other agent in the needs-input and finished groups, is drawn a few percent lighter than the terminal's reported background. Plain terminals show a $ in the agent-number column so their names line up with agents', and waiting agents carry their tree number in the same column.

